  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoring Essential Services for Health and Advancing Preparedness for Emergencies Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Project are to: (i) improve utilization of reproductive and child health services in priority regions, (ii) strengthen public health capacities for emergency preparedness, and (iii) in case of an Eligible Crisis or Emergency, respond promptly and effectively to it.</narrative>
  </description>
